If you don't really value your time much, or you literally make money gaming, then this game is for you. I'll say that The developers have done an amazing job with this game they deserve 90% of our blessings. They do in fact have both free to play and memberships as well as bonds (hybrid). (Warning) you should probably level up all your free skills at least to level 30 before becoming a member. i used to play this game in middle school, so I was blown away when it came to the App Store a tad indistinguishable from the original yet much better than how I remembered; 
(Cons)
